  "title": "习近平在光山县深入油茶园和农村考察调研",
  "date": "2019-09-17 15:01:13",
  "author": "新华社",
  "editor": "(责编：王静                        )",
  "article": "<div class=\"d2txt_con clearfix\">\n<p></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">\n习近平总书记17日上午前往河南省光山县司马光油茶园和文殊乡东岳村，考察调研当地脱贫攻坚工作成效和中办在光山县扶贫工作情况，看望慰问老区群众。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗）</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0917/MAIN201909171500000178822128140.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0917/MAIN201909171500000285860869652.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0917/MAIN201909171500000376206828876.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0917/MAIN201909171500000479042277290.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0917/MAIN201909171500000574963354273.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0917/MAIN201909171501000065580197595.jpg\"/></p>\n</div>",
  "text": [
    "习近平总书记17日上午前往河南省光山县司马光油茶园和文殊乡东岳村，考察调研当地脱贫攻坚工作成效和中办在光山县扶贫工作情况，看望慰问老区群众。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗）"
  ]
}
